  S7: Verify the post-change record and report the outcome (vendor ID, new bank details, evidence of approval/verification) to the requester. (done when: GET 
/erp/vendors/<vendor_id> confirms 91801009999999 / UTIB0000999 (or the blocked/escalated branch is confirmed) and the result has been communicated.)
